                                    ],
                                    "type": "text",
                                    "content": "Ladies and gentlemen,"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ],
                    "index": 2,
                    "merge_prev": false
                },
                {
                    "bbox": [
                        51,
                        128,
                        542,
                        263
                    ],
                    "type": "text",
                    "angle": 0,
                    "lines": [
                        {
                            "bbox": [
                                51,
                                128,
                                542,
                                263
                            ],
                            "spans": [
                                {
                                    "bbox": [
                                        51,
                                        128,
                                        542,
                                        263
                                    ],
                                    "type": "text",
                                    "content": "At the outset, I would like to express our sincere appreciation to the Chair, and all Members of the working party for accommodating our request to convene this meeting at the earliest possible date. Maintaining this pace is particularly important in light of Uzbekistan's objective of completing its accession process in 2026."
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ],
                    "index": 3,
                    "merge_prev": false
                },
                {
                    "bbox": [
                        52,
                        266,
                        541,
                        333
                    ],
                    "type": "text",
                    "angle": 0,
                    "lines": [
                        {
                            "bbox": [
                                52,
                                266,
                                541,
                                333
                            ],
                            "spans": [
                                {
                                    "bbox": [
                                        52,
                                        266,
                                        541,
                                        333
                                    ],
                                    "type": "text",
                                    "content": "In the interest of making the best use of our time today, allow me to keep my remarks concise and focused on the key factual developments since our previous meeting."
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ],
                    "index": 4,
                    "merge_prev": false
                },
                {
                    "bbox": [
                        52,
                        335,
                        542,
                        448
                    ],
                    "type": "text",
                    "angle": 0,
                    "lines": [
                        {
                            "bbox": [
                                52,
                                335,
                                542,
                                448
                            ],
                            "spans": [
                                {
                                    "bbox": [
                                        52,
                                        335,
                                        542,
                                        448
                                    ],
                                    "type": "text",
                                    "content": "First, we can observe that the number of written questions submitted by most Members of the Working Party has been steadily declining. We consider this an important indication that Members' concerns are being progressively addressed and that the accession process has reached a more advanced stage."
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ],
                    "index": 5,
                    "merge_prev": false
                },
                {
                    "bbox": [
                        51,
                        450,
                        542,
                        587
                    ],
                    "type": "text",
                    "angle": 0,
                    "lines": [
                        {
                            "bbox": [
                                51,
                                450,
                                542,
                                587
                            ],
                            "spans": [
                                {
                                    "bbox": [
                                        51,
                                        450,
                                        542,
                                        587
                                    ],
                                    "type": "text",
                                    "content": "In parallel, we have continued working closely with the WTO Secretariat on the draft Working Party report. The comments and proposals submitted by Members have been carefully considered and, where appropriate, reflected in successive revisions. This work has contributed to consolidating the text and more clearly identifying the issues that remain outstanding."
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ],
                    "index": 6,
                    "merge_prev": false
                },
                {
                    "bbox": [
                        52,
                        589,
                        542,
                        725
                    ],
                    "type": "text",
                    "angle": 0,
                    "lines": [
                        {
                            "bbox": [
                                52,
                                589,
                                542,
                                725
                            ],
                            "spans": [
                                {
                                    "bbox": [
                                        52,
                                        589,
                                        542,
                                        725
                                    ],
                                    "type": "text",
                                    "content": "Taken together, these developments indicate that the process is gradually moving from clarification towards conclusion. In line with the Chair's support, the focus should now increasingly shift to the remaining commitment language, with a view to finding balanced and workable solutions, incorporating the agreed language into a consolidated draft and advancing the Report towards finalization."
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ],
                    "index": 7,
                    "merge_prev": false
                },
                {
                    "bbox": [
                        52,
                        727,
                        541,
                        772
                    ],
                    "type": "text",
                    "angle": 0,
                    "lines": [
                        {
                            "bbox": [
                                52,
                                727,
                                541,
                                772
                            ],
                            "spans": [
                                {
                                    "bbox": [
                                        52,
                                        727,
                                        541,
                                        772
                                    ],
                                    "type": "text",
                                    "content": "Progress is also well advanced in the other principal negotiating tracks."
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ],
                    "index": 8,
                    "merge_prev": false
                }
            ],
