        {
            "preproc_blocks": [
                {
                    "bbox": [
                        52,
                        58,
                        541,
                        148
                    ],
                    "type": "text",
                    "angle": 0,
                    "lines": [
                        {
                            "bbox": [
                                52,
                                58,
                                541,
                                148
                            ],
                            "spans": [
                                {
                                    "bbox": [
                                        52,
                                        58,
                                        541,
                                        148
                                    ],
                                    "type": "text",
                                    "content": "With respect to agricultural domestic support, I believe that Members of the Cairns Group would share our assessment that the discussions have reached their final stage. The remaining issues are limited and can be resolved operatively."
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ],
                    "index": 1,
                    "merge_prev": false
                },
                {
                    "bbox": [
                        52,
                        151,
                        541,
                        264
                    ],
                    "type": "text",
                    "angle": 0,
                    "lines": [
                        {
                            "bbox": [
                                52,
                                151,
                                541,
                                264
                            ],
                            "spans": [
                                {
                                    "bbox": [
                                        52,
                                        151,
                                        541,
                                        264
                                    ],
                                    "type": "text",
                                    "content": "The same can be said of the bilateral market-access negotiations. The process is at a highly advanced stage, with the most recent milestone being the signing of a bilateral protocol with India. As of today, 31 of the 34 bilateral protocols signed by Uzbekistan have been deposited to the WTO Secretariat."
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ],
                    "index": 2,
                    "merge_prev": false
                },
                {
                    "bbox": [
                        52,
                        266,
                        542,
                        425
                    ],
                    "type": "text",
                    "angle": 0,
                    "lines": [
                        {
                            "bbox": [
                                52,
                                266,
                                542,
                                425
                            ],
                            "spans": [
                                {
                                    "bbox": [
                                        52,
                                        266,
                                        542,
                                        425
                                    ],
                                    "type": "text",
                                    "content": "On the legislative and institutional front, since our previous meeting, Uzbekistan has brought the total number of legal acts harmonized with WTO rules to more than 190. The most significant progress has been achieved in SPS and food safety, including the establishment of a unified Food Safety Committee, the introduction of risk-based controls throughout the farm-to-fork chain and the advancement of the revised draft Law on Food Safety to the Senate."
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ],
                    "index": 3,
                    "merge_prev": false
                },
                {
                    "bbox": [
                        52,
                        428,
                        542,
                        564
                    ],
                    "type": "text",
                    "angle": 0,
                    "lines": [
                        {
                            "bbox": [
                                52,
                                428,
                                542,
                                564
                            ],
                            "spans": [
                                {
                                    "bbox": [
                                        52,
                                        428,
                                        542,
                                        564
                                    ],
                                    "type": "text",
                                    "content": "In parallel, the draft laws on anti-dumping, countervailing and safeguard measures have been thoroughly revised to ensure consistency with WTO Agreements, make their provisions more precise and predictable, and address Members' concerns. The latest drafts reflecting these revisions were circulated to Members for consideration last week."
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ],
                    "index": 4,
                    "merge_prev": false
                },
                {
                    "bbox": [
                        52,
                        566,
                        542,
                        633
                    ],
                    "type": "text",
                    "angle": 0,
                    "lines": [
                        {
                            "bbox": [
                                52,
                                566,
                                542,
                                633
                            ],
                            "spans": [
                                {
                                    "bbox": [
                                        52,
                                        566,
                                        542,
                                        633
                                    ],
                                    "type": "text",
                                    "content": "These developments leave us with a clear task: to translate the progress already achieved into agreed language, close the remaining gaps and bring the accession process to completion."
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ],
                    "index": 5,
                    "merge_prev": false
                },
                {
                    "bbox": [
                        52,
                        635,
                        541,
                        678
                    ],
                    "type": "text",
                    "angle": 0,
                    "lines": [
